WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.130
Nvidia Reinstates Jensen

00:00:01.942 --> 00:00:03.309
Huang as CEO

00:00:03.846 --> 00:00:05.532
Nvidia has reinstated

00:00:05.344 --> 00:00:06.570
Jensen Huang as

00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:07.100
CEO

00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:08.327
just eleven days

00:00:08.138 --> 00:00:09.459
after his resignation

00:00:09.648 --> 00:00:10.520
in a dramatic

00:00:10.332 --> 00:00:11.357
reversal at the

00:00:11.169 --> 00:00:12.643
world's most valuable

00:00:12.455 --> 00:00:13.315
chipmaker

00:00:13.846 --> 00:00:15.084
Shares of Nvidia

00:00:14.896 --> 00:00:16.605
closed up 31%

00:00:16.417 --> 00:00:18.374
following Huang's reinstatement

00:00:18.513 --> 00:00:19.562
Huang and the

00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:20.234
board held their

00:00:20.046 --> 00:00:21.248
first conversations

00:00:21.060 --> 00:00:21.956
since his ouster

00:00:21.768 --> 00:00:22.652
on Saturday

00:00:22.841 --> 00:00:23.501
and the group

00:00:23.312 --> 00:00:24.314
determined he would

00:00:24.126 --> 00:00:25.399
return as CEO

00:00:25.211 --> 00:00:26.095
during a second

00:00:25.907 --> 00:00:26.932
meeting on Sunday

00:00:27.004 --> 00:00:27.958
the people said

00:00:28.502 --> 00:00:29.374
The stock had

00:00:29.186 --> 00:00:31.084
shed nearly 33%

00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:31.685
from the time

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:32.523
Huang admitted to

00:00:32.335 --> 00:00:33.832
an extramarital affair

00:00:33.644 --> 00:00:34.527
on Nov.

00:00:35.046 --> 00:00:36.060
Full story on

00:00:35.871 --> 00:00:36.767
the dashboard
